 5                                                                                                                                          
 6  ─ Moving ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── 
 7    h j k l                    move (never off the line)                                                                                  
 8    w b e W B E                word / WORD motions                                                                                        
 9    zz zt zb                   center/top/bottom the cursor line                                                                          
 10    H M L                      top/middle/bottom visible line                                                                            
 11    g;                         older change (changelist)                                                                                 
 12    g,                         newer change (changelist)                                                                                 
 13    ge gE { }                  word-end back / paragraph motions                                                                         
 14    - +                        line up / down, on the first non-blank                                                                    
 15    ( )                        sentence back / forward                                                                                   
 16    [( [{ ]) ]}                the unmatched bracket before / after                                                                      
 17    g_ g0 g^ g$ gj gk          last non-blank; line start, first non-blank,                                                              
 18                               end; line down / up                                                                                       
 19    gn gN                      select the next / previous search match (cgn                                                              
 20                               then . changes each)                                                                                      
 21    0 $ G %                    line/file/pair jumps                                                                                      
 22    gg                         top of file                                                                                               
 23    enter                      line down, first non-blank (collection: open                                                              
 24                               the file here; blame: the line's commit)                                                                  
 25    tab                        jump list forward (ctrl-i)                                                                                
 26    ctrl-d ctrl-u ctrl-f ctrl-b                                                                                                          
 27                               half/full page scroll (count = lines)                                                                     
 28    ctrl-e ctrl-y              scroll the window one line down / up                                                                      
 29    ctrl-^                     alternate buffer                                                                                          
 30    grr                        references (LSP)                                                                                          
 31    grn                        rename the symbol under the cursor (prompts                                                               
 32                               with its name)                                                                                            
 33    gra                        actions here, as space a (code actions;                                                                   
 34                               Neovim's key)                                                                                             
 35    gri gI                     implementation (LSP)                                                                                      
 36    gy                         type definition (LSP)                                                                                     
 37    gD                         declaration (LSP)                                                                                         
 38    ]d                         next diagnostic                                                                                           
 39    [d                         previous diagnostic                                                                                       
